    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点3：系统函数的应用",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            147,
            85,
            406,
            105
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、求解系统方程 $H(s)=\\frac{R_{zs}(s)}{E(s)}=\\frac{右边形式}{左边形式}$",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            118,
            495,
            147
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、求解系统的冲激响应： $H(s)\\xrightarrow{\\text{逆变换}}h(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            158,
            539,
            175
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3、求解系统的阶跃响应： $G(s)=\\frac{H(s)}{s}\\xrightarrow{\\text{逆变换}}g(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            187,
            601,
            222
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "4、求解系统的零状态响应： $R_{zs}(s)=H(s)\\cdot E(s)\\xrightarrow{\\text{逆变换}}r_{zs}(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            233,
            677,
            253
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 18: 已知微分方程 $r''(t) + 3r'(t) + 2r(t) = e'(t) + 3e(t)$ ， $e(t) = e^{-4t}u(t)$ ，求 $h(t)$ 、 $g(t)$ 、 $r_{zs}(t)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            290,
            847,
            341
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "5、求解系统某一特征值的复频域响应",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            476,
            484,
            494
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "若输入为 $e^{s_0t}$ ，则对应输出为 $H(s_0)e^{s_0t}$ 【要求 $s_0$ 在ROC内， $s_0$ 为复常数】，当 $s_0 = 0$ 时，输入为直流信号 $E = E \\cdot e^{0 \\cdot t}$ (E看为系数)，则对应的输出 $E \\cdot H(0) \\cdot e^{0 \\cdot t} = E \\cdot H(0)$",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            505,
            776,
            589
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "B站up：信号与系统\\_谷哥",
        "bbox": [
            115,
            24,
            344,
            42
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "公众号：通信考研小马哥",
        "bbox": [
            653,
            24,
            880,
            42
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "footer",
        "text": "官网：tongxinkaoyan.com",
        "bbox": [
            117,
            956,
            354,
            973
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "footer",
        "text": "梦马班讲义",
        "bbox": [
            774,
            954,
            878,
            973
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "6、系统零极点分布判断系统内在特性【详见下一节内容】",
        "bbox": [
            142,
            85,
            663,
            104
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "【新增引例与分析】",
        "bbox": [
            152,
            187,
            329,
            206
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) 系统响应分解: 自由+强迫, 零输入+零状态, 稳态+暂态;",
        "bbox": [
            154,
            539,
            732,
            560
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) 稳态存在的条件:",
        "bbox": [
            156,
            568,
            366,
            588
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3) 如果稳态存在，一定存在于。。。。。。。响应中。",
        "bbox": [
            156,
            671,
            638,
            690
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "B站up：信号与系统\\_谷哥",
        "bbox": [
            115,
            24,
            344,
            43
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "公众号：通信考研小马哥",
        "bbox": [
            652,
            23,
            880,
            43
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "footer",
        "text": "官网：tongxinkaoyan.com",
        "bbox": [
            115,
            956,
            356,
            975
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "footer",
        "text": "梦马班讲义",
        "bbox": [
            773,
            954,
            880,
            973
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 20: 已知 $H(s)=\\frac{s+2}{s^{2}+5s+4}$ ，激励为 $e(t)=5\\cos(2t)u(t)$ ，求输出信号。",
        "bbox": [
            142,
            85,
            778,
            120
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "7、求稳态响应",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            144,
            707,
            285,
            725
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1)稳态响应存在的条件：当输入为阶跃信号或者有始周期信号时，稳定系统的完全响应分解为稳态+暂态，其中稳态通常由阶跃信号或有始周期信号组成；如果输入非阶跃信号或非有始周期信号或系统为不稳定系统，则完全响应不能按此分解，在输入为阶跃或有始周期信号时，稳定系统的强迫响应也称稳态响应。",
        "bbox": [
            142,
            734,
            850,
            837
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2)在完全响应中，当 $t\\to\\infty$ 时，等于0的部分称之为瞬(暂)态响应，剩余部分称之为稳态响应。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            846,
            850,
            892
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "B站up：信号与系统\\_谷哥",
        "bbox": [
            115,
            24,
            344,
            42
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "公众号：通信考研小马哥",
        "bbox": [
            653,
            24,
            880,
            42
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "footer",
        "text": "官网：tongxinkaoyan.com",
        "bbox": [
            115,
            956,
            354,
            975
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "footer",
        "text": "梦马班讲义",
        "bbox": [
            774,
            954,
            880,
            973
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3)激励为三角信号时的稳态响应",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            85,
            442,
            102
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "若激励为 $e(t)=E_{m}\\sin(\\omega_{0}t)$ 或 $e(t)=E_{m}\\cos(\\omega_{0}t)$",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            111,
            541,
            131
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "则系统稳态响应结果： $r_{ss}(t)=E_{m}H_{0}\\sin(\\omega_{0}t+\\varphi_{0})$ 或 $r_{ss}(t)=E_{m}H_{0}\\cos(\\omega_{0}t+\\varphi_{0})$",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            142,
            801,
            162
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(4)稳态响应的求解步骤:",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            174,
            371,
            191
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "①根据 $e(t)$ 明确 $E_{m}$ 和 $\\omega_{0}$ 的大小",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            200,
            426,
            219
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "② $H(j\\omega_{0})=H(s)/s=j\\omega_{0}$ ，将 $H(j\\omega_{0})$ 化成一个复数 $z=a+bj$ （明确实部和虚部）",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            230,
            848,
            263
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "③ $H_{0} = \\left|H(j\\omega_{0})\\right|$ ， $\\varphi_{0}$ 为相角【 $z = a + bj$ $\\quad |z| = \\sqrt{(a^2 + b^2)}$ $\\quad \\varphi = \\arctan{\\frac{b}{a}}$ 】",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            278,
            806,
            311
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "④将 $E_{m},\\omega_{0},H_{0},\\varphi_{0}$ 带入结论。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            322,
            403,
            342
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 19: 已知 $H(s)=\\frac{s+2}{s^{2}+5s+4}$ ，激励为 $e(t)=5\\cos(2t)u(t)$ ，求稳态响应。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            378,
            778,
            414
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "B站up：信号与系统\\_谷哥",
        "bbox": [
            115,
            24,
            344,
            42
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "公众号：通信考研小马哥",
        "bbox": [
            653,
            24,
            880,
            42
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "footer",
        "text": "官网：tongxinkaoyan.com",
        "bbox": [
            117,
            956,
            354,
            975
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "footer",
        "text": "梦马班讲义",
        "bbox": [
            774,
            954,
            878,
            973
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(5) 激励为三角信号时的响应 (严格不能称之为稳态响应)",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            87,
            643,
            104
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "若激励为 $e(t)=E_{m}\\sin\\left(\\omega_{0}t\\right)$ 或 $e(t)=E_{m}\\cos\\left(\\omega_{0}t\\right)$",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            118,
            588,
            137
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "则系统稳态响应结果:",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            148,
            344,
            164
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr _ {s s} (t) = E _ {m} H _ {0} \\sin (\\omega_ {0} t + \\varphi_ {0}) \\text {或} r _ {s s} (t) = E _ {m} H _ {0} \\cos (\\omega_ {0} t + \\varphi_ {0})\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            231,
            179,
            761,
            198
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "【梦马班点拨】对稳态的总结：",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            154,
            662,
            426,
            678
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} & H (s) \\quad \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} s = j \\omega \\\\ H (j \\omega) \\end{array} \\right. \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} \\cos (\\omega_ {0} t) & \\longrightarrow \\text {输出:} | H (j \\omega_ {0}) | \\cos [ \\omega_ {0} t + \\varphi (\\omega_ {0}) ] (\\text {不加} u (t)) \\\\ \\cos (\\omega_ {0} t) u (t) & \\longrightarrow \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} \\text {稳态:} | H (j \\omega_ {0}) | \\cos [ \\omega_ {0} t + \\varphi (\\omega_ {0}) ] u (t) \\\\ \\text {输出:} [ \\sum_ {i} A _ {i} e ^ {\\alpha_ {i} t} + | H (j \\omega_ {0}) | \\cos [ \\omega_ {0} t + \\varphi (\\omega_ {0}) ] ] u (t) \\end{array} \\right. \\end{array} \\right. \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            690,
            727,
            873
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "B站up：信号与系统\\_谷哥",
        "bbox": [
